  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Shared sub-workflow called by Transaction Execution, Statement Request, and Account Closure before any sensitive action executes (n8n Spec Sec. 3). Enforces: SUSPENDED fixed-rejection (FR-6.5), per-holder password verification scoped to account_holders.transaction_password_hash (FR-6.9), failed-attempt counter with 3-strike suspension (FR-6.4/FR-6.5), and immediate suspension notification pointing to the Account Reactivation flow (FR-6.8)."
  },
